# State: the job named `job` is the active job every page works on (picked in Setup's job list).
# Vars: job (default Initial survey) = the job's exact name; the list item is matched by name, so the
#       job's name alone resolves "Initial survey (MOB-001)".
# Passive-safe: no `key` steps. Leaves the app on the Setup page.
#
#   run lib/app-select-job job='Initial survey'
#   pwsh -NoProfile -WorkingDirectory geodc -File dev/ui.ps1 do --file dev/ui-scripts/lib/app-select-job.ui --var "job=Initial survey"
@target app
@var job=Initial survey

run lib/app-goto-page page=SetupTab
wait --id JobList
select --id JobList --item '${job}'
assert --id JobNameInput --value '${job}' --timeout 3
